        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Igūlū ipya na sī mhya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nūbona igūlū ipya na sī mhya; nguno ī ligūlū lya kwandya nī sī ī ya kwandya shalī shamala kūbīta, nī nyanza yalī ītīho hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū nzengo ng'wela ū gwa Yelusalemu mhya nūgūbona gūlika kūfuma ng'wigūlū kūlī Mulungu, gūbeegelejiwe gītī ntoolwa wigolanyaga kūlwa nguno ya ngoshi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niigwa ilaka itaale kūfuma a hī Isumbi lya būtemi līlīhaya gīkī, “Managa gīkī, ū wikalo bo ng'wa Mulungu būlī hamò na banhū, akwikala hamò nabo, babize banhū bakwe; nū wei ng'wenekīlī ū Mulungu akūbiza hamò nabo, abize Mulungu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akūshipyagūla ī shisoji shīnge pyī ū mu miso gabo, na kūtalabiza ho kūcha hangī, nūūlū būpīna, nūūlū ng'hūngū; pye nūūlū kūluha kūtalabiza ho, nguno ī ya kwandya īkūbiza yamalaga kūbīta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūyo walī igashije a hī Isumbi lya būtemi ūhaya gīkī, “Managa gīkī, būlī shikolo nalīshīta shibize shipya!” Hangī ūhaya, “Andīkaga gīkī, ‘Ī mihayo yenīyī īlī ya kūsanyiwa, na ya ng'hana.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī ūniwīla, “Yashila! Ū nene nalī Alufa na Omega, Wandījo na Būkalīkījo; ūyo akolilwe nota nakūng'winha ang'we dalali kūfuma mu lwinzī lo minzī mapanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūpyena akūbiza ng'wingīji wayo ī yenīyī, hama ū nene nakūbiza Mulungu wakwe, nū wei akūbiza ng'wana wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a booba na a bagomi, na a basoso, na a babūlagi, na a bajingi, na a balogi, na a balamya ba shiikolile; pye na a balomolomo, a bene ū ngabo gwabo gūlī mu nyanza ya kūbaka moto na būgota bo shibiliti, hū kūcha kwa kabīlī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yelusalemu mhya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama wiza ūmò wa bamalaika mpungatī abo baalī na nzweso jokalile sha kūluhya luhya mpungatī. Aho washika ūniyombya; ūniwīla gīkī, “Nzūgū nakoolekeje ū Ntoolwa, ū nke wa Ng'wana wa Ng'holo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūnibūūcha mu mbika ya Kiimoyo, ūnitwala kū lūgūlū lūtaale hangī lūlīhu, ūnoolekeja ū nzengo ng'wela ū gwa Yelusalemu, nūgūbona gūlika kūfuma ng'wigūlū kūlī Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwalī n'ikūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu, ū būlabagīzu wago walī gītī w'iwe lya mpango ntaale, gītī iwe lya yaspi, gītī būpe w'ilole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwalī gūpīndīlījiwe ndugu nhaale hangī ndīhu no; hama gwalī na mibita ikūmi n'ībīlī na bamalaika ikūmi na babīlī baalīho a ha mibita yenīyo, na a mina ga ng'anda ikūmi n'ibīlī ja Baisilaeli gaalī gandīkilwe ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū lwandī lo kīya yalīko mibita idatū, nū lo sukuma mibita idatū, nū lo dakama mibita idatū, nū lo ng'weli mibita idatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ndugu ya nzengo yalī na misingi ikūmi n'ībīlī; na a mina ga batūng'wa ikūmi na babīlī ba Ng'wana wa Ng'holo gaalī gandīkilwe ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo waniwīlaga walī n'idete lya zahabu lya kūpimīla, agūpime ū nzengo nī mibita yago, nī ndugu yago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mhandī ja nzengo būne wajo jalī jilenganīlile, ū būlīhu boolī būlenganīlile nū būgalī galī; aho wagūpima nī lidete lyenīlo gūbiza na būlīhu gītī kilomita 2,400, pyī nū būgalī galī, nū būgūngūhu ū kūja ū ng'wigūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wīpima ī ndugu ū būgīnu wayo būbiza gītī magūlū makūmi atandatū na atandatū, ū kūlenganīla nī shipimo sha banhū, īsho watūmamīlaga ū malaika ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ndugu yenekīlī yalī īzengilwe na yaspi, alīyo ū nzengo, ū gwene gwalī gwa zahabu yawiza ndabagīzu gītī ilole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye ī misingi ya ndugu yalī ītūūlīlilwe būlenji bo mawe ga mpango ntaale, ū nsingi go kwandya yalī yaspi, ū go kabīlī safilo, ū go kadatū kalikedoni, ū go kane sumaladi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū go katanò salidoniko, ū go katandatū salidioni, ū go mpungatī kilisolito, ū go kanaane belilo, ū go kenda topazio, ū gw'ikūmi kilisopulaso, ū gw'ikūmi na gūmò yakonto, ū gw'ikūmi n'ibīlī ametisto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mibita īy'ikūmi n'ībīlī yenīyo jalī lūūlū ikūmi n'ibīlī; būlī mita lūūlū īmò, hama ī libbalabbala lya mu nzengo lyalī lya zahabu yawiza ya kūng'weka ng'weka gītī ilole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natabonile mo hekalu, nguno ū Seeba Mulungu wa būdūla bose, nū Ng'wana wa Ng'holo hū ng'wene alī hekalu yamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ū nzengo gwenūyo gūtī na nguno ya būpe bo līīmi nūūlū bo ng'weji, nguno ī likūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu hū lyene īlo līkagwakīīlaga, hama ū Ng'wana wa Ng'holo hū ng'wene ūyo alī tala yamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mahanga gakūbiza ga kūshimīzīla ng'wisana lyago; na a batemi ba mu sī bakwenha mo ī likūjo lyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mibita ya nzengo gwenūyo ītīko kūlugalwa na hado yaya pyī ī shikū, nīyo būtīho būjikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ikūjo lya mahanga na būkumīlīja shikwenhwa mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī shikolo sha malofu shitingīla mo na hado yaya, na a babo bakīītaga ya būsoso, pye na a balomolomo. Bakwingīla mo dūhū abo bandīkilwe mu shitabo sha būpanga ī sha Ng'wana wa Ng'holo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
